  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 404.08 Display, Applicability, and Validity of Permit to Operate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 404.08 Display, Applicability, and Validity of Permit to Operate.\n\n(a) As required by RSA 146-C:4, II, a permit issued under this part shall be displayed on the premises of the UST facility at all times. The permit shall be permanently affixed on the premises in a location that is visible to a department inspector during a routine inspection.\n\n(b) The permit to operate shall apply to all UST systems at the facility.\n\n(c) The permit to operate shall be valid unless suspended or revoked as specified in Env-Or 404.11.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400) #10393, eff 9-1-13; ss by #12643, eff 10-10-18 (formerly Env-Or 404.07) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or400.html"
